{"id":"razum","lemma":"разум","pos":"noun","rank":1263,"glosses":["reason, mind, intellect"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"разума","plural":"разумы"},"examples":[{"text":"Том совершенно потерял разум.","en":"Tom completely lost his mind.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"perfectly"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},null]},{"text":"Том не хотел слышать голос разума.","en":"Tom didn't want to listen to reason.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to hear"},{"g":"voice"},null]},{"text":"Мой разум блуждал.","en":"My mind wandered.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты что, разума лишился?","en":"Have you lost your mind?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to be deprived of","l":"лишиться"}]},{"text":"Страх усыпляет разум.","en":"Fear numbs the mind.","words":[{"g":"awfully"},null,null]}]}